{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 11, :comments ["The meaning of <b>לא תגנבו</b> [you shall not steal]: afterward. For thus I have commanded you to give of your own to the poor, for the honor of HaShem — all the more so [that you not] take what belongs to others." "The meaning of <b>תגנובו</b>: for one who sees and is silent is also a thief." "<b>תכחשו.</b> [You shall not deal falsely] regarding a deposit placed with you, and one who knows and does not testify is also dealing falsely." "<b>תשקרו.</b> [You shall not lie] by seeking money from one who owes you nothing."], :book :leviticus, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 19, :notes {0 "The word אחר כך (afterward) is syntactically abrupt; translated hyper-literally as transmitted."}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:10:54.127576626Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}